{"meta":{"id":"log-detail","category":"aide/common-rules","title":"로그 세부 레벨 (LOG_DETAIL·LOG_TZ·900번대)","subtitle":"","summary":"LOG_TZ 타임존, 경로별 등급 LOG_LEVEL_PATHS, 세부 레벨 1~5, 테스트 로그 900번대(LOG_TEST), 텍타임 기록 기준","tags":["aide","규칙","로그"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-indigo","source":"aide_agents/1-rules","updatedAt":"2026-10-18"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>1-rules</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2026-10-18</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">로그 세부 레벨 (LOG_DETAIL·LOG_TZ·900번대)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/70 border border-indigo-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> LOG_TZ 타임존, 경로별 등급 LOG_LEVEL_PATHS, 세부 레벨 1~5, 테스트 로그 900번대(LOG_TEST), 텍타임 기록 기준</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">타임존 (LOG_TZ)</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">타임존은 서버 OS가 아니라 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>.env</code>의 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>LOG_TZ</code>(기본 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>Asia/Seoul</code>) — 컨테이너는 OS가 UTC이거나 tz 데이터가 없어, OS를 따르면 일반 로그와 프롬프트 로그의 날짜 파일이 어긋난다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">파일을 나누는 날짜도 같은 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>LOG_TZ</code> 기준</span></div></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">경로별 등급 (LOG_LEVEL_PATHS)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">bash</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">LOG_LEVEL=INFO                                       # 전역 기본값\r\nLOG_LEVEL_PATHS=app.auth:DEBUG,app.payment:WARNING   # auth만 디버깅, payment는 경고 이상만</pre></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">로거 이름은 모듈 경로(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>logging.getLogger(__name__)</code> → <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>app.payment.service</code>)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">앞부분 일치, 겹치면 더 긴 경로가 이긴다. 목록에 없으면 전역 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>LOG_LEVEL</code></span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">폴더 이름을 바꾸면 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>.env</code> 경로도 같이 고친다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">핸들러 등급은 열어 두고 로거에서 거른다(핸들러가 INFO면 DEBUG가 막힌다)</span></div></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">세부 레벨 (LOG_DETAIL)</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">등급과 별개로 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">세부 레벨 1~5</strong> — 숫자가 작을수록 상세. 출력 조건은 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>등급 &gt;= LOG_LEVEL</code> <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">이고</strong> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>세부 &gt;= LOG_DETAIL</code>.</p><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">세부</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">분류</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">남기는 것</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">예</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">5</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">핵심</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">상태 변화·처리 결과 요약, WARNING 이상 전부</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">서버 시작/종료, 작업 완료</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">4</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">사용량</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">비용·자원 지표</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">AI 토큰, 처리 건수, 메모리</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">3</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">성능</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">처리 소요 시간(텍타임)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">요청 단위·함수 단위 소요 시간</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">2</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">입출력</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">외부와 주고받은 것의 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">메타</strong></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">파일 경로/용량, API 호출 요약</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">1</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">원문·추적</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">주고받은 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">내용 자체</strong>, 미분류 DEBUG</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">프롬프트 원문, 요청/응답 바디</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">미설정·범위 밖 값은 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>1</code>(전부 출력). WARNING 이상은 항상 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>5</code>로 고정</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">세부 미지정 로그: INFO는 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>5</code>, DEBUG는 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>1</code></span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">세부 값은 로그 모듈에 상수로(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>DETAIL_TACT = {&quot;detail&quot;: 3}</code>) — 호출부에서 숫자를 직접 쓰지 않는다</span></div></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">bash</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">LOG_LEVEL=INFO  LOG_DETAIL=4   # 운영: 핵심 + 사용량 + WARNING 이상\r\nLOG_LEVEL=INFO  LOG_DETAIL=3   # 운영 성능 확인: 요청 단위 텍타임까지\r\nLOG_LEVEL=DEBUG LOG_DETAIL=3   # 개발 성능 확인: 함수 단위 텍타임까지\r\nLOG_LEVEL=DEBUG LOG_DETAIL=2   # 개발: 입출력 메타까지\r\nLOG_LEVEL=DEBUG LOG_DETAIL=1   # 로컬 디버깅: 원문까지 전부</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">테스트·임시 로그 (900번대)</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">잠깐 확인용 로그는 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>901</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>902</code> … 테스트 종류마다 번호 하나 — 메시지 앞 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>[T901]</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>grep &quot;\\[T901\\]&quot;</code>로 골라 본다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">파일은 따로 만들지 않는다 — 서비스 로그와 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">같은 파일</strong>에 시간순으로</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>.env</code>의 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>LOG_TEST=901,902</code>로 켠다. 미설정이면 900번대 전부 꺼짐(운영에 안 섞임). WARNING 이상은 항상 출력</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">테스트가 끝나면 번호로 검색해 지우고, 남길 로그는 1~5로 옮긴다</span></div></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">텍타임 (세부 3)</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">요청 단위는 프레임워크 훅에서 한 번에: <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>[ROUTER] POST /path status=200 elapsed=123.45ms</code></span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">함수 단위는 데코레이터: <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>[요청ID] [TACT] 모듈.함수 elapsed=123.45ms</code>, 예외로 끝나도 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>(error)</code></span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">처리 시간이 긴 함수(파일 입출력, 집계·결합, AI 호출, 차트)에만. 얇은 래퍼·반복 호출 작은 함수·요청 핸들러·generator에는 붙이지 않는다</span></div></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">함께 지킬 것</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">외부 라이브러리(httpx, openai, urllib3) 로그는 WARNING 이상만, uvicorn 등 프레임워크 로거는 같은 핸들러로 모은다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">콘솔과 파일에는 같은 내용 — 출력 판정은 한 곳에서만</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">Python 구현: 소규모까지 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>logger.py</code>, 중규모부터 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>logger_ext.py</code>(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>3-modules/5-class/1-log/</code>)</span></div></div></div>\r\n","path":"aide/common-rules/log-detail","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"aide","title":"aide","path":"aide"},{"id":"common-rules","title":"1-rules (공통 규칙)","path":"aide/common-rules"}],"hasImage":false}